config BR2_PACKAGE_DDR_TOOLS
	bool "ddr-tools"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
	help
	  The read eye of the Amlogic G12B's DDR PHY at run time
	  (docs/boards/ogu.md, "Память: подстройка задержек чтения"):
	  ddr-phyreg (read and write its registers), ddr-eyescan (move
	  one delay until memory reads wrong) and ddr-calibrate (find
	  the lanes BL2's training leaves off-centre; ddr-tune keeps the
	  result for U-Boot).
